1... Ne7 (1... g1=N+ 2. Kg3 Ne2+ (2... Ne7 3. Bd1 $1 {leeads to the main line}
) 3. Kf2 Nc3 4. Ke3 $10 {e.g.} 4... Ne7 (4... Na6 5. Kd3)  (4... Kh2 5. Kd3 $10
Nb5 6. Ba4 Ne5+ 7. Ke4 $10) 5. Kd4 Nb5+ 6. Kc5 $10) 2. Bd1 (2. Bc2 g1=N+ 3. Kg3
Ne2+ $19) 2... g1=N+ {Three knights win against one bishop, so White must
exchange the bishop against one of the knights.} 3. Kg3 Nf5+ 4. Kf4 Nd6 5. Ke5
Nb5 6. Ba4 $1 (6. Bc2 $2 Nd7+ 7. Kd5 Nf6+ 8. Kc5 Nc3 $19) 6... Nc3 7. Be8 $1
