knight on b8 is trapped.} )  (7... Na6 {<main>} 8. Kd4 $1 Nce2+ 9. Kc4 Nf4 10.
Bf7 Nb8 11. Be8 Na6 12. Bf7 {posiional draw} ) 8. Kd6 {Threatens Bc6.} 8... Kg1
(8... Nd4 9. Kc7 Na6+ 10. Kb6 Nb4 11. Kc5 $10) 9. Bc6 Nd4 (9... Nd2 10. Bb7 $1
$10) 10. Be4 $3 {Reaching the d3 square is key.}  (10. Bb7 $2 Ndb5+ 11. Kc5 Kf2
$19) 10... Ndb5+ (10... Kf2 11. Kc7 Na6+ 12. Kb6 Nb4 13. Kc5 $10)  (10... Ncb5+
11. Kd5 Na6 12. Bd3 $10)  (10... Nb3 11. Bd3 $10)  (10... Na6 11. Bd3 Nb4 12.
Kc5 $10) 11. Kc5 Kf2 (11... Nd7+ 12. Kb4 $10) 12. Bd3 Nd7+ (12... Na6+ 13. Kb6)
13. Kb4 1/2-1/2

